  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "44ab9d17-aa42-4cb1-9a34-e19748c59e8d"],
 " key of the pairing object. The inverse of an ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ExteriorProduct"]], "paclet:IBLInfinity/ref/ExteriorProduct", 
    "IBLInfinity Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "549615ab-ab45-49c2-a04d-af005c108c22"],
 " is taken against the same pairing object as the forward map."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"daabdf66-2cd6-4f09-872c-d39b2e3df8dc"],

